00:40:33,460 --> 00:40:35,630
Uh, yes, we can.

794
00:40:35,720 --> 00:40:37,770
How could you possibly be so calm?

795
00:40:37,850 --> 00:40:40,640
I don't know. I hated losing just as much as everyone,

796
00:40:40,720 --> 00:40:43,020 but this year wasn't about winning for me.

797
00:40:43,090 --> 00:40:45,390
Clearly, 'cause we got our asses kicked.

798
00:40:45,460 --> 00:40:47,310
Yeah.

799
00:40:47,390 --> 00:40:49,310
Sorry.

800
00:40:49,400 --> 00:40:51,280
What was it about?

801
00:40:51,360 --> 00:40:54,120
Acceptance.

802
00:40:54,200 --> 00:40:58,150
I know that all the kids in the glee club... they fight,

803
00:40:58,240 --> 00:41:00,820 and they steal each other's boyfriends and girlfriends,

804
00:41:00,910 --> 00:41:04,230 and they threaten to quit, like, every other week,

805
00:41:04,290 --> 00:41:06,500 but weird stuff like that happens in families.

806
00:41:06,580 --> 00:41:08,910
Yeah, well, this is a club.
This is not a family.

807
00:41:08,970 --> 00:41:11,170
Okay, well, family is a place

808
00:41:11,250 --> 00:41:13,290 where everyone loves you no matter what,

809
00:41:13,340 --> 00:41:15,090 and they accept you for who you are.

810
00:41:15,140 --> 00:41:17,220
I know I'm going to be a bridesmaid at Mike

811
00:41:17,290 --> 00:41:18,560 and Tina's wedding, and I'm gonna be

812
00:41:18,630 --> 00:41:19,730 anxiously awaiting, just like everyone else,

813
00:41:19,790 --> 00:41:21,490 to see if their babies are Asian, too.

814
00:41:21,560 --> 00:41:23,630
When they find an operation to make Artie's legs work again,

815
00:41:23,680 --> 00:41:26,270
I'm going to be there for his first steps.

816
00:41:26,320 --> 00:41:29,190
I love them.
I love everyone in Glee Club.

817
00:41:29,270 --> 00:41:30,970
And I get to spend another year

818
00:41:31,020 --> 00:41:32,640 with everyone I love, so, I'm good.

819
00:41:32,710 --> 00:41:34,570
What about you and I?

820
00:41:34,640 --> 00:41:36,530
I love you, Santana.

821
00:41:36,610 --> 00:41:37,940
I love you more

822
00:41:37,990 --> 00:41:40,300 than I've ever loved anyone else in this world.

823
00:41:40,360 --> 00:41:43,530
All I know about you and I is that, because of that,

824
00:41:43,620 --> 00:41:45,480
I think anything's possible.

825
00:41:50,010 --> 00:41:52,120
You're my best friend.

826
00:41:52,180 --> 00:41:53,680
Yeah, me, too.

827
00:42:02,170 --> 00:42:04,140
When did you get so smart?

828
00:42:11,060 --> 00:42:12,950
Where have you been?

829
00:42:13,010 --> 00:42:14,230
Hiding out.

830
00:42:14,310 --> 00:42:15,780
Everyone hates me.

831
00:42:15,850 --> 00:42:17,830
No, they don't.
It doesn't explain why

832
00:42:17,900 --> 00:42:20,700 you haven't said a word to me since we've been back.

833
00:42:20,770 --> 00:42:23,290
'Cause you should be more pissed at me than anyone else.

834
00:42:23,360 --> 00:42:24,740
I screwed up!

835
00:42:24,820 --> 00:42:26,980
I'm humiliated.
We worked so hard

836
00:42:27,040 --> 00:42:28,380 for everything,

837
00:42:28,450 --> 00:42:30,910 and I was supposed to be this big shot leader,

838
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:34,850 holding everyone together, and... I blew it.

839
00:42:34,920 --> 00:42:37,140
Cost us the championship.

840
00:42:37,200 --> 00:42:39,390
Look, being an artist

841
00:42:39,470 --> 00:42:41,370 is about expressing your true feelings,

842
00:42:41,420 --> 00:42:44,210 in the moment, no matter what the consequences.

843
00:42:44,260 --> 00:42:46,280
What were you feeling in that moment?

844
00:42:46,350 --> 00:42:48,160
That I loved you.

845
00:42:50,580 --> 00:42:53,090
And that I would have done or given anything

846
00:42:53,150 --> 00:42:55,020 to kiss you one more time.

847
00:42:55,070 --> 00:42:57,220
So you did.

848
00:42:59,080 --> 00:43:02,440
You know, you gave it all up for one kiss.

849
00:43:02,530 --> 00:43:04,950
Yeah.

850
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:06,920
Was it worth it?

851
00:43:08,120 --> 00:43:10,020
Yeah.

852
00:43:10,090 --> 00:43:11,950
What about you?

853
00:43:13,710 --> 00:43:16,110
Was it worth it for you?

854
00:43:17,290 --> 00:43:19,030
Yeah.

855
00:43:20,960 --> 00:43:22,550
'Cause I know in my heart

856
00:43:22,600 --> 00:43:24,120 we'll have another shot at Nationals.

857
00:43:24,180 --> 00:43:28,200
You have to know that I...
I'm leaving, Finn.

858
00:43:28,270 --> 00:43:30,940
I'm going to New York, and I'm never coming back.

859
00:43:32,140 --> 00:43:34,640
Graduation's a year away.

860
00:43:34,730 --> 00:43:37,100
You got any plans till then?

861
00:43:47,070 --> 00:43:48,990
Okay. Let's go.

862
00:43:49,080 --> 00:43:51,080
Where are we going?

863
00:43:51,130 --> 00:43:52,910
Final Glee Club meeting of the year.

864
00:43:55,950 --> 00:43:57,630
No other show choir

865
00:43:57,720 --> 00:44:00,390 who finished in 12th place has ever felt so honored.

866
00:44:07,180 --> 00:44:08,790
Hi.
Hi.

867
00:44:08,850 --> 00:44:10,560
Hi.
Hiya. Come on.

868
00:44:10,630 --> 00:44:13,070
You guys want to see what 12th place looks like?

